      "side": 1,
      "message": "Overridable functions are hard to discover when creating new boards. The callback routine is preferred because the registration function becomes part of the public API for the body detect module.\n\n```\n/* body_detection.h */\nenum body_detect_states body_detect_get_state(void);\nvoid body_detect_change_state(enum body_detect_states state, bool spoof);\n/* ... */\nvoid body_detect_register_callback(body_detection_cb_t callback);\n/* ... */\n\n```",
